<!--
  Hand-made test city near Tbilisi (UTM 38N). City square lat 41.70-41.75, lon 44.70-44.80, split into
  West (r1001, admin_level 6) and East (r1002, admin_level 10) subareas at lon 44.75.
  r1003 is an admin boundary inside West that is NOT a subarea and must not become a district.
  Roads:
    w2001 + w2002  "Split Street" / "Split  Street"   share node 202 -> one merged street
    w2003, w2004   "Twin Street" 2.2 km apart        -> two streets
    w2005          unnamed residential               -> dropped
    w2007 service, w2009 footway, w2010 access=private, w2011 primary_link -> dropped
    w2006          "Cross Avenue" (primary), ~830 m in each district -> both districts
    w2008          "Edge Lane" (tertiary), ~83 m (17 %) in East -> West only
    w2012 + w2013  "North Road" and "Ridge Road" share node 221   -> a junction (road graph)
    w2014          "Bridge Road" crosses North Road with no shared node -> no junction there
  Places drawn as areas:
    r1004 quarter "შუა" (lat 41.705-41.745, lon 44.705-44.735)              -> neighbourhood
    w114 / w115 neighbourhoods "ტყუპი" around Twin Street w2003            -> only the smaller w114
    w116 neighbourhood "ცარიელი" with no streets                            -> dropped as too thin
-->
